comments.body:
@participant2 

What's the before and after values of the disk space on restart?

I tried to reproduce this issue locally several times with dummy data but I was not able to find anything amiss. Are you able to reproduce it locally easily?

@participant2

Thanks for confirming that compaction works. I wonder why the automatic level-based compaction isn't kicking in. It does when I tried to repeatedly import + drop a dataset that takes about 350M of disk space. 

What's the size of the `db` directory after a fresh import? Is it also in the range of ~700M?
